        "raw": "<p>Wasn&#39;t sure where to put this but here seems as good as any...</p><p>I just received an invoice from Fedex (posted, not e-mailed) saying that I have to pay some charges which appear to relate to the shipping of my copy of GSF, listing two amounts - &quot;Disbursements out of the scope of EU VAT&quot; at &pound;3.64 and &quot;Clearance Administration Charge Vatable at 0%&quot; at &pound;10.75 for a total of &pound;14.39. I wasn&#39;t aware there would be any more charges or anything for GSF - I thought it had all been paid and stuff. Did anyone else get one of these invoices or has there been some kind of mistake made along the way which means something didn&#39;t get paid which should have? I don&#39;t recall ever seeing anywhere that I would have some ectra charges so I&#39;m a bit confused...</p>",
