        "created_at": "2014-06-10T05:58:05.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I got one of these too. The £3.64 is the import tax you owe FedEx that they paid on GSF, the rest is what they're charging for paying the tax for you. Even more expensive than Royal Mail, but they won't give you your packages until you've paid them!</p>",
